# Nativa — Colab Training Notebook
# 
# This notebook runs on Google Colab T4 (16GB VRAM)
# Steps:
# 1. Install dependencies
# 2. Download Qwen3.5-4B
# 3. Test stock model for refusals
# 4. Abliterate if needed (OBLITERATUS)
# 5. Fine-tune with LoRA on trading data
# 6. Convert to GGUF + quantize
# 7. Download GGUF to local machine
#
# Usage: Upload to Google Colab, run all cells

# ============================================================================
# CELL 1: Install dependencies
# ============================================================================
# !pip install torch transformers accelerate bitsandbytes peft trl datasets
# !pip install huggingface_hub llama-cpp-python
# !git clone https://github.com/elder-plinius/OBLITERATUS.git
